OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFog slowly clearing, though it
OL,6,Fmay linger into the afternoon in
OL,7,Fplaces. Otherwise largely bright with
OL,8,Fsome sunny spells and feeling mild.
OL,9,FBreezier in the northwest, with rain
OL,10,Fpossible across northwest Scotland.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry with variable
OL,13,Famounts of cloud. Areas of fog, dense
OL,14,Fin places, developing across England
OL,15,Fand Wales. Thicker cloud affecting the
OL,16,Ffar northwest of Scotland. Feeling
OL,17,Fmild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
