OL,5,CSaturday:FAreas of fog lingering
OL,6,Facross parts of England and Wales,
OL,7,Fthough some sunny spells will develop.
OL,8,FA little rain affecting the far
OL,9,Fnorthwest of Scotland, sinking
OL,10,Fsouthwards during the day.
